{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BURN BRIGHTER!! INITIATE DRY CONTACT!! 30 bosses await in the insurmountable  run-and-gun</i>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/steampreviewgif2.gif?t=1749479876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>----- STORY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Earth reaches the precipice of apocalypse, a lone boy with vengeful eyes rushes towards <u><strong>KaiserCorps</strong></u>, the leading authority on weapons technologies and the epicenter of an alien rampage. Discover the backstory of <u><strong>Geverel</strong></u>, the hollow soldier, through non-linear storytelling with comic-style art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>----- GAMEPLAY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burst through 8 stages, each loaded with 1-on-1 duels against KaiserCorps' insane experiments and top infantry. Go blazing with 4 different types of guns, then slam a centrifuge of raw energy into your enemies with the <u><strong>Tatsujin Punch</strong></u> and <u>Ignition Dash Explosion.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(<strong>Disaster Arms</strong> is intended to be played in one sitting with limited continues like an arcade game - however, an unlimited continue mode is provided for casual and newcoming players.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>----- FEATURES -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>30 bosses</strong></u> - from giant machine-monster hybrids, to your vengeful soldier brethren</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Shmup/Bullet Hell</strong></u> design philosophy meets action platformer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish artstyle and <u><strong>multi-sprite animation</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Strafe-based shooting</strong></u> controls let you evade while keeping your aim on the target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strike enemy weakpoints for <u><strong>maximum damage</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinct pre-apocalypse setting: Prevent the incoming dystopia!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Original soundtrack composed using YM2151+SN76489</strong></u>, the signature sound hardware of the 16-bit MD/GEN consoles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462730?t=1749479876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/ad39dced0080a25cec921adc3d21bdf5b44af03e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749479876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/485b11ae19cf019d8e98d25f4a2776ec425403e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749479876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/485b11ae19cf019d8e98d25f4a2776ec425403e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749479876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3718030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BURN BRIGHTER!! INITIATE DRY CONTACT!! 30 bosses await in the insurmountable  run-and-gun</i>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/steampreviewgif2.gif?t=1749479876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>----- STORY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_p